Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Beyond Redemption
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 23
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.37,0:00:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where would Cha Erlang keep the antidote?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Something so precious…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,he wouldn’t carry it on him, would he?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.61,0:00:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, why are you so absent-minded?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.68,0:00:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Jay, if we accidentally get hit by the Boss’s miasma,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.88,0:00:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,what should we do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.76,0:00:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.48,0:00:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.60,0:00:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve never been afflicted by it myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but a companion of ours once accidentally breathed in the miasma.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.48,0:01:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You could ask him about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.64,0:01:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right—he would definitely know about the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.77,0:01:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.81,0:01:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn’t be walking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.97,0:01:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust Wolffy will bring the antidote soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.57,0:01:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m afraid I can’t wait that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.89,0:01:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I have another way; come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.29,0:01:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,To what do I owe the pleasure of this visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.49,0:01:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I see your face is drained of color and your eyes look listless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.65,0:01:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the rumors are true; you’ve been afflicted by a potent miasma.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.45,0:01:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the chatter—how can this miasma be cured?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.97,0:02:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It can’t be cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.86,0:02:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.61,0:02:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There is one method I could try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.19,0:02:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Delicious century eggs, mysterious tears…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.63,0:02:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,…and a smile full of joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.26,0:02:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is one ingredient in particular that is truly unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.98,0:02:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.58,0:02:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A sandshark’s reverse scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.51,0:02:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A sandshark?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.14,0:02:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t that quite common?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.66,0:02:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It is, but as for the reverse scale…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.58,0:02:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the Golden Sandshark has it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.02,0:02:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we trust what he says?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.18,0:02:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have indeed heard before
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.78,0:02:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,that the Golden Sandshark’s reverse scale has miraculous properties.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.98,0:02:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But those sandsharks are incredibly ferocious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.46,0:02:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And this time, it has to be the {\i1}Golden{\i0} one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.43,0:02:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How about I give you two extra bottles of water?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.71,0:02:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard everything you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.31,0:03:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I can supply the other ingredients for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.23,0:03:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But you’ll have to get that reverse scale yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.26,0:03:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s too dangerous; I’m not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.24,0:03:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.24,0:03:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.44,0:03:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, Big Sister; you still have us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.27,0:03:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to hurry back and report to Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.82,0:03:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t you get hit by the miasma a while back?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.68,0:03:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You should rest more if you’re not feeling well; I’ll help you with the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.64,0:03:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.99,0:03:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But the miasma was cleared up ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.43,0:03:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you cure it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.63,0:03:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know where the antidote is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.64,0:03:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss provides it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.04,0:03:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You just have to go and queue up to get it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.59,0:04:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the antidote is just being handed out like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.55,0:04:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.91,0:04:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss is worried that one of our own might accidentally get exposed to the miasma again,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.84,0:04:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,so he’s distributing the antidote now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.11,0:04:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about a stroke of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.59,0:04:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you helping me with my work?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.24,0:04:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your own work yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.27,0:04:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.31,0:04:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot open your eyes for three days after taking the medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you’ll go permanently blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.92,0:04:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a catch like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and take this to Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.11,0:04:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.08,0:04:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But I’ve got other things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.00,0:04:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.84,0:04:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Jay, come into the cockpit with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re going into the cockpit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.03,0:04:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I might be able to see the map and find the rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.83,0:04:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.19,0:04:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,let me handle such a tough job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.91,0:04:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are a model worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.43,0:05:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Go assemble those parts; we’ll need them later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.83,0:05:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t you say we were going to the cockpit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.99,0:05:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The utility room next to the cockpit counts as part of the cockpit, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.22,0:05:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How did it come to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.47,0:05:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t get away now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.66,0:05:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the Golden Sandshark right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.02,0:05:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there are so many small sandsharks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.23,0:05:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,In what way are they small?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.84,0:05:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see that glowing reverse scale on its body?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.58,0:06:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.24,0:06:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay here and wait for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.83,0:06:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.07,0:06:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t get the reverse scale if we keep getting dragged along by the sandshark like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.31,0:06:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to find a way to restrain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.82,0:06:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.34,0:06:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.52,0:06:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishy, I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.60,0:07:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s something glowing in its gills.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.16,0:07:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s a reverse scale. It’s like a bad tooth to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.27,0:07:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s why it’s so agitated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.28,0:07:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn’t mean to disturb you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Removing that reverse scale won’t be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.03,0:07:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re injured now; let me take the reverse scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.54,0:07:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, let’s do it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.74,0:07:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.46,0:07:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the sandsharks behind you to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.66,0:07:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Its back is too slippery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.22,0:07:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I could have pulled them out with a line.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.83,0:08:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Weslie!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.15,0:08:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.63,0:08:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s all set up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.91,0:08:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But why is Boss setting up such a huge cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.07,0:08:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t you know? This cage is for catching Blue Scarf and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.26,0:08:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The Boss found out Blue Scarf was looking for a sandshark’s reverse scale to make an antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.58,0:08:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s waiting for Blue Scarf and the sandshark to wear each other out in a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.26,0:08:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we can swoop in and reap the rewards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.94,0:08:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie must be with her right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.02,0:08:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to give them a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.01,0:08:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if there’s any news from the people Boss sent out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you suddenly wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.88,0:09:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.63,0:09:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They’ve all gone into hiding; we can’t find where they are at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.22,0:09:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.10,0:09:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Weslie, the sandshark is to your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.47,0:09:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,To think you could spot the sandshark’s trail like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.46,0:09:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyesight is excellent; I’ll help you keep watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.30,0:09:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out behind you, Big Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.82,0:09:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Weslie, it’s up ahead to your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.66,0:09:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.50,0:09:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.62,0:10:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.78,0:10:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s the Golden Sandshark—watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.82,0:10:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.62,0:10:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cha Erlang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.46,0:10:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t be rash; let’s retreat for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.02,0:10:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you’re already here, there’s no need to rush off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.77,0:10:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you’re already here, there’s no need to rush off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.39,0:10:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, I’ll finish you off myself before the symptoms kick in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.83,0:10:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Go retrieve the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.63,0:10:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.03,0:11:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, if we don’t leave now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.27,0:11:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,the Sandshark is going to tear the vehicle apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.18,0:11:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Scarf, we’ll settle our score another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.78,0:11:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, forget about the cage; let’s get out of here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.90,0:11:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Cha Erlang and the sandshark are both gone. Does that mean we’re safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.84,0:11:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.83,0:11:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.83,0:11:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to get you treated for the miasma quickly…but how do we break the cage open?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.48,0:11:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, open the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.11,0:11:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.64,0:11:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister…Big Sister…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.44,0:11:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the earlier battle cause the miasma to spread?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.12,0:11:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, hurry and bring the antidote over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.72,0:12:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.12,0:12:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.24,0:12:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever I wasn’t feeling well, Mom used to hold me just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.64,0:12:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s…you.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
